{"version":1,"content":"<p>天王郭富城首個於啟德主場館舉行的跨年演唱會將在下月開鑼，正全力投入綵排的他，在曝光的幕後花絮中大擺Chok爆甫士，氣場全開。</p><p>談到今次舞台設計，目的希望帶給大家一些回憶，並坦言對個唱只有一個要求，就是讓全場觀眾在開心氛圍下感受普天同慶的喜悅。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T13:41:50.913871+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T13:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:15.274970+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:15.274970+00:00","content_hash":"6d4d3196d6cffc9d43b3c42bee827da821e1a51cffebb6b8418a43ad7b47e037","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}